Package: com.minis.squidgesture
Name: SquidGesture
Version: 1.5.4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: System-wide gestures plus a pull-up app launcher panel. Swipe up from the bottom-right corner to open a panel of your own apps (add/remove freely). Edge swipes, corner taps and multi-finger gestures also included.
Maintainer: Minis
Author: Minis
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), ellekit | mobilesubstrate
